  tmux/session.go). Run in parallel.
- Step 3 depends on Step 1 (uses session state types) and Step 2
  (RenameSession used by Step 7, but Step 3 itself only needs state types).
- Step 4 depends on Step 3 (needs sessionState in model to build localRows).
- Step 5 depends on Step 4 (needs local row type) and Step 2 (uses ListRepos,
