11. **Dynamic column width**: Agent column expands when compound state is displayed, title column shrinks accordingly
12. **Session history overlay**: Autonomous sessions show correct state icons; enter on running session switches to tmux; enter on failed session follows up
13. **Prompt correctness**: Autonomous agent prompt includes lifecycle preamble with correct status file path + action-specific command
